  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large pan, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooked onion and carrots, red lentils, HP sauce, binchotan charcoal powder, vegetable broth, tomato paste, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Mix well to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Cover the dish with aluminum foil and bake for 30 minutes.",
    "Remove the foil and continue baking for an additional 20 minutes."
